 5 + 4 = 9.\n\nThe difference in their numbers is now 5 - 4 = 1.\n\nThe answer is 1"]}], "Response": ["1"], "Attempt answer": "1", "Solved": true, "Total solved": 34, "Total executed": 44, "Accuracy": 0.7727272727272727}
